      <data key="d0">adjoining sites</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="b6131148102cc57289e98398aa2f6f12f272f7bf7a74b79c37fa2dcea9f10b43">
      <data key="d0">The document outlines planning requirements for Marrickville DCP 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="31a4d9f95c6f0e1e90f7e5ed02e759789c7ad880fd31d871a2116d65f427425e">
      <data key="d0">Clause 2.3 - setback (development_control) is included in these requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7ceeea1893ea38e4f8b9e92b27a28cc2706bda1a0c9f8f5b95a524b92ce9c10b">
      <data key="d0">Front setbacks and front projections are defined in Clause 2.3.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ce287aec7edcec31540327d8388334281be82d822d33dbe1029d0eff35ac624d">
      <data key="d0">Side setbacks are also defined in this clause</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="b4caa479fa896dc8c45f10c0e5a23880a079c0a993d4cb6c61c14d81f013c80d">
      <data key="d0">Eaves height is specified as part of the height_limit requirements.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="bf3ba092d47a9d1b72586755328f9d4cdc08fb8e32602afb1aa820e00ca9869f">
      <data key="d0">Clause 2.3.1 - environmental_protection (environmental_protection) outlines environmental considerations</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="993b219ed68aafe16662e4bc07f6bfd3205b68f76f52ee836810bf74264b4ce8">
      <data key="d0">Minimising overshadowing, loss of privacy and views are key objectives.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="cd8a5bd224fd1ceda8a47fca3f51db0587a2ea1467486086b0a579afa79bf8b1">
      <data key="d0">The development must integrate within the streetscape when considering scale, proportion and massing</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="f02beeed72d0e5460b6eaba66bb88cfeea5f9d8c7f2d2712363f314668a32b09">
      <data key="d0">The site and context analysis must demonstrate that the building will sit comfortably with surrounding buildings in terms of its massing.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0e958e116fe9f3129dcbd6a2daa2818f56da675d858f69ebeb6bdfd8c4073466">
      <data key="d0">The site and context analysis must also demonstrate that the building is well proportioned, both as an individual element and within the streetscape</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e28dba21aa1116408cbf168d43a4ceac2fae9b7f8d82a45b14f6047d95115a8a">
      <data key="d0">Any endangered ecological community (EEC), significant trees or other vegetation on the site must be identified.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="32767a96620b1eeed96d3974eecc3f0507cb2852bbf8546fb869b54fc16681f3">
      <data key="d0">Other existing trees upon the site or close to boundaries with adjoining sites must also be considered</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="bb3eea6fd4752792ab398c6dbf8d2a0216e8eb2ad420984c2c8cf8311a22f738">
      <data key="d0">The front setbacks and front projections must be considered.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="8544f0516cd07594e29964ee482b6e249b8e3b6876b94811af53c255874bf43f">
      <data key="d0">Front setbacks</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="3aff3e34dc37cf54b4c88b5c6acf7823bff776b468f3322bf8a134c789252c35">
      <data key="d0">Front projections</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7dd09d46f6f90521d77947589b7960df2552d8235dcc9891bc679124eb201d75">
      <data key="d0">Eaves height must be limited.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="a34e1feeebef7b90cff38ab312105e4ca46a41539124c23c486fec23c5116f51">
      <data key="d0">Eaves height</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="32ca174c79b7be7dae841c5a04815c58bcaf7afe2fa54b8b93e5e38dd23457f2">
      <data key="d0">Overshadowing, loss of privacy and views must be minimised.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0a8debeb73ef9421193d58cf2b2f27bc0e0fa2c80b37bbfb3ee41c7ed01d32d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5990aee701bbe6ba0edc1e7111de67c062ed51dea529d9bb494cc2a079c00928">
