      <data key="d0">resident numbers</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="98366e6bea24549c0c3108b8dbb26ca58ce40c85e1bec542e827305d731ae835">
      <data key="d0">Development applications for boarding houses in the R2 – Low Density Residential zone will be assessed in accordance with the relevant controls in Section 4.1 of this DCP.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="39378ff6ff278703d3e2997820cf7fe5351ef8e509ea021b8b0608bb7f90591a">
      <data key="d0">The controls in Section 4.1 relate to low density residential development and objectives in Section 4.3.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="07daaa50573f51c5474d30a304df15a3db0b84ca699bd0ec3230799542324b6a">
      <data key="d0">Development applications for boarding houses in the R1 – General Residential, R3 – Medium Density Residential and R4 – High Density Residential zones will be assessed in accordance with the relevant controls in Section 4.2 of this DCP.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="6b0e03572d4c6a85091f021eb21d279cd0c853b423d485bb58c16ba013c71a8c">
      <data key="d0">The controls in Section 4.2 relate to multi dwelling housing and residential flat buildings and objectives in Section 4.3.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="204bd9c5182eca1190ffdf2d1e243ad281ae5d6cf28e2e5c01534fbf78464a25">
      <data key="d0">Development applications for boarding houses in the B1 - Neighbourhood Centre Zone, B2 - Local Centre Zone and B4 - Mixed Use zones will be assessed in accordance with the relevant controls in Section 5 of this DCP.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="3d1574dcd8da599e669d41188718bece074d701367cece5acfbd7bd2ba7d9692">
      <data key="d0">Car parking requirements for boarding houses are detailed in Table 1 in Section 2.10 Parking.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="573c015f5c5daf5ecaf3dc131b4b01985e60575d34ff51a7c0a2ec7c646b6b2f">
      <data key="d0">The planning document has specified the zones where development applications will be assessed.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c0691bd0cfa820faaedcbca9e8ab34e411d650476c9ebe7cbf443d741acf2907">
      <data key="d0">Parking provision rates for boarding houses are lower than for residential flat buildings to reflect an expected lower car ownership rate and to facilitate housing affordability.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="a29ecfd4b387aa8f3f4f40db123f22beaf5634ffb18e9ba7a35d268299837d50">
      <data key="d0">The parking rates for boarding houses are most constrained in Parking Area 1 (most of Camperdown, Newtown and Enmore area, major commercial strips and around railway stations) and least constrained in Parking Area 3 (outlying areas).</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1ec3f6cc1a3c8ca207aac2bf4e442cecf7a7fb1158c4d6f892571424e19849ef">
      <data key="d0">Where a boarding house is on the site of a heritage item or within a heritage conservation area, the proposal will also need to comply with the relevant heritage planning controls contained in Part 8 of this DCP.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0b0248a9754e045f3e839bf9109b5c761b5171960d30954b176f1cda74d0f9ad">
      <data key="d0">The design of a boarding house is to be compatible with the character of the local area, and ensure there are no negative impacts on the amenity of the local area.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="91a38f295a09006d7d4eea224f9b160b72d0d869a92da78565d97e8b7e28405f">
      <data key="d0">Resident numbers will be determined based on the gross floor area of the boarding room (excluding any area used for the purposes of private kitchen or bathroom facilities).</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5ff7c11f856ced071abfcc16abd2717f42092c0c605c0264027b645cee6d724d">
      <data key="d0">An area of private open space, at least 8 square metres with a minimum</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5919bc62a315c2c96bc61b2072639fe5d988e063c47e5ef0dc8c3f7458ecb0f8">
      <data key="d0">Development applications for boarding houses in the R2 – Low Density Residential zone will be assessed in accordance with the relevant controls.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">77ba4428337d5208112f27b98ddfcec209554256d629f6cffa422d440fee9636</data>
    </node>
