    <node id="76f1a124edf38447eba70121493c4ecbc6f108ad91033c521d9432ccef87f453">
      <data key="d0">To encourage residential development which is sensitive to the local environment, socially responsive and which promotes a safe living environment and makes better use of existing infrastructure.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">6e9dfb651c768bd6849955c61d1835fd85920f27822667a2f9a3c03766dd6c86</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1560d212d976b85ee188fdb3058556a0ed87eb924e8e96e75532a858ee960735">
      <data key="d0">To ensure the impact of urban housing on the amenity of surrounding properties and the streetscape is a prime and initial consideration in the preparation and assessment of development proposals.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
