    <node id="8fd4c5f4d4a9d694fad37ff881cb33500d1a9cbd17fd231018ad846587b1bad5">
      <data key="d0">Childcare centres are permitted with consent in R1 - General Residential zones.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="41cb18e0c1025ccb18337b8a373c6147865951b7e8fdef7e27ecf55c255c7c9b">
      <data key="d0">Child care centres are detailed in Section 2.10 regarding car parking requirements.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="647f917f7404ad7ce9ca665d21cc0a31e2579714b579268a7a9389175fd5fe24">
      <data key="d0">Car parking requirements for child care centres are detailed in Section 2.10.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ddccfaae3e1799e083dcf5ba457340bb71ba1c7bed237dc23afc1685450f5b21">
      <data key="d0">Where a child care centre is on the site of a heritage item or within a heritage conservation area, the proposal will also need to comply with the relevant heritage controls.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="809f178a7e61f1bed8224de0f350a53f32e107793d00219d04e25b5f6be5a79e">
      <data key="d0">Child care centres must have at least one lift access to all floors, including to any basement parking.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="100875a26bda8ed8189e4cc50e8f07ad86fb7127a1c8bf162e675ec848df59d5">
      <data key="d0">The premises should remain residential in external appearance and finishes and be consistent with the nearby residential streetscape and landscape.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="45bb835217f3a2245c2e6077f83be99f8826081e2703fa7c64f75531ba1aea00">
      <data key="d0">Child care centres in a residential zone will be assessed for impact on residential amenity.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1cfeee7ff5e728695d8261ca45a1aee1d12ca067d3b68e8ad671cdbeb750d72e">
      <data key="d0">Child care centres in a residential zone will only be acceptable where adverse impacts on the amenity of residents in the neighbourhood can be are avoided or minimised to an acceptable level.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e919a0b5c4d0c346315f7accf129546b37288e3592cab430e1661f7966b6a222">
      <data key="d0">Do not locate a child care centre on a state road.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="354dd94d2651ce85fbc2245b3efc31644b9289f64243b0669c0e98632eb4e023">
      <data key="d0">Under Inner West LEP 2022 child care centres are permitted with consent in the following zones</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">fcbd5439e7551b9b625e286c630ae7c390ce0acdbcda54485c21744b5d33b12f</data>
    </node>
