    <node id="bb0510679409348fe63e22b07331e439efc36137e606f3a2ea927b112cf6e8a8">
      <data key="d0">Clause 7.3 - zoning (land_use_zoning) deals with land use zoning.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e5fdc95050125be21d9694a8c979ab2222687e6ffba519733e358863ba25d317</data>
    </node>
    <node id="52aea870cd333895fda1e37b58a14e59b87403c99e278b6b94c127e3813c06df">
      <data key="d0">Clause 7.3.1 - other (development_control) aims to ensure sufficient separation between adult businesses, restricted premises, sex on premises venues and sex services premises.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e5fdc95050125be21d9694a8c979ab2222687e6ffba519733e358863ba25d317</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ab2cdf791e4c2d7635cb39f2b1c62e0f5da834aae680f6928b707ca8b14e5015">
      <data key="d0">Clause 7.3.1 - other (development_control) aims to protect the locality's amenity.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e5fdc95050125be21d9694a8c979ab2222687e6ffba519733e358863ba25d317</data>
    </node>
    <node id="dd9fce74ce45b03ee1ffa22718963dde035d24bb03b01a3ce29430dbf0698da2">
      <data key="d0">To ensure sufficient separation between adult businesses, restricted premises, sex on premises venues and sex services premises.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e5fdc95050125be21d9694a8c979ab2222687e6ffba519733e358863ba25d317</data>
    </node>
    <node id="674224e8aa54eae5a73d3b545b5d525ce71ae85d95e7643872b6262f4d0ace3f">
      <data key="d0">a concentration of those premises in any one locality should be avoided.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e5fdc95050125be21d9694a8c979ab2222687e6ffba519733e358863ba25d317</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0c1e9f68db3c13851a6c68f7490f2e1fc9dc3d505c5ddf2728958f12a9b3f57c">
      <data key="d0">Clause 7.3.1 - other (development_control) aims to ensure adult businesses, restricted premises, sex on premises venues and sex services premises are located, designed and operated in a manner that protects the amenity of the locality.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e5fdc95050125be21d9694a8c979ab2222687e6ffba519733e358863ba25d317</data>
