    <node id="737f90fbb2562e163d6b69452589e44cf98929ddff629555f4b8ec742e0a8edf">
      <data key="d0">Buildings that make a positive contribution to the character of the HCA should be retained</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">4e8b32259fd70f7822ec12306c4bc2c3e4de4189d4c02bf1a0a1c511f9d268a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="46695c3fbdd1045a15da1ed9357c610337bfcfcfee54804eaf8f153f69164370">
      <data key="d0">Demolition of buildings that positively contribute to the character of the HCA will generally not be supported</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">4e8b32259fd70f7822ec12306c4bc2c3e4de4189d4c02bf1a0a1c511f9d268a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="9ca68bd5078ad8ee6950d1a61763dab69a78ca853a50117403455dd16f2deec3">
      <data key="d0">Original building materials such as brick, sandstone, timber and slate should be retained and repaired where possible.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">4e8b32259fd70f7822ec12306c4bc2c3e4de4189d4c02bf1a0a1c511f9d268a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="be3c01ac69cecb783fa3caebd40ea6b33535dc529aef5b31c9a5f2fc76b4ff13">
      <data key="d0">New development should respect the scale and massing of existing buildings in the HCA.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">4e8b32259fd70f7822ec12306c4bc2c3e4de4189d4c02bf1a0a1c511f9d268a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="a757e55911da238f94e8cb0e75a9ea530e38bd9cf1ec7198f64a28f27eaaced6">
      <data key="d0">New building facades should be compatible with the architectural style and materials of existing buildings in the HCA.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">4e8b32259fd70f7822ec12306c4bc2c3e4de4189d4c02bf1a0a1c511f9d268a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7e868fa7ad5cac83ed6a8bd2f0189c36eaa578a8ff7a825952121dd57b6d1b15">
      <data key="d0">Roof forms and pitches of new development should be compatible with existing buildings in the HCA.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">4e8b32259fd70f7822ec12306c4bc2c3e4de4189d4c02bf1a0a1c511f9d268a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e1f3eca2ff51a59dded8a06aa148fe0c18c15e5b33ee2834e446c3af533b38e5">
      <data key="d0">Landscaping should be used to enhance the character of the HCA.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">4e8b32259fd70f7822ec12306c4bc2c3e4de4189d4c02bf1a0a1c511f9d268a4</data>
