    <node id="10366868788cf47869a30133590e6fd901bde2b69231ff2576053a59460a3b91">
      <data key="d0">Each planning precinct has its own distinct character and provides an important contextual basis for establishing appropriate types of development in association with other controls within the DCP.</data>
