    <node id="00b441eae88d14cc92df730ee6981c0a4fe762152f7f6a3a35955eb7401fc8b0">
      <data key="d0">The precinct contains a heritage listed water board site in Weston Street which is substantially vacant except for a small brick building.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">281f9b9327302b3b395dfc9e224e53bc1c462fb1c2911b1d66e18eb6396f32e5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7d9ea488392a40559888ad770d4c13a180a6118101267d6c117064dc06f79553">
      <data key="d0">The former Waratah flour mills and associated buildings (also heritage items) along the railway line are land mark buildings within this precinct and can be seen from a number of streets.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">281f9b9327302b3b395dfc9e224e53bc1c462fb1c2911b1d66e18eb6396f32e5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="dc61aec26cda5445578069a9a0bbd44e3e92a1e43ec30d9af230e9605aaad5b0">
      <data key="d0">The land-use pattern of the precinct is predominantly low density residential areas with some medium density development.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">281f9b9327302b3b395dfc9e224e53bc1c462fb1c2911b1d66e18eb6396f32e5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e91796d1797e7617feaca42fd1ed95b32a1239990a602bec71460c7dec19296e">
      <data key="d0">Front setbacks are generally consistent within each street despite the variety of buildings styles. A setback of 2 metres to 4 metres is the most common.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">281f9b9327302b3b395dfc9e224e53bc1c462fb1c2911b1d66e18eb6396f32e5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ed211cb6c419981c5a09035ed5d9274fe11f2bc8a09abd44f6d796a3ae013881">
      <data key="d0">In areas of the precinct where off street parking is provided it is most frequently a side drive to a hardstand/carport behind the building line.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">281f9b9327302b3b395dfc9e224e53bc1c462fb1c2911b1d66e18eb6396f32e5</data>
    </node>
