      <data key="d0">It is essential that development within the precinct considers the potential impacts to biodiversity including native fauna (including Threatened Species and Endangered Populations), native vegetation (including Endangered Ecological Communities), and habitat elements (including their condition, structure, function, connectivity and disturbance).</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">656a66f97b9376208aa4511dd0328416e211f846df84c8f5ea4aa363def2d893</data>
