    <node id="68f55288322f8aa801ac531fab043d4d90ac472428f2071642feb538a6dbe2fe">
      <data key="d0">Five storey buildings fronting the Princes Highway are to have the fifth level and roof (including any open pergolas) set back from the external wall of the floor below by a distance of 3 metres, measured from the building alignment facing the Princes Highway.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">29d0a7d1ad76ae2ed0cf16d6a8f6a465b4b7970655f0f6ec29e8feae6af0a612</data>
