    </node>
    <node id="dd3a8037db38d5f0a9788f10bdbf9988db92af155eef3144dad9a76b01b48541">
      <data key="d0">The most notable building within the precinct is the ‘Australia Street industrial group’ heritage item located between Denison Street and Australia Street.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2495b33287d1f6304ced931b4ac805cde1c598fe0bcec8a89be8caaa85215af9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e6ade9ad26e3de3253155ade9284ce70e88fae2d8103e2ad780534e8c9dc6997">
      <data key="d0">Most buildings are built to the street with a nil setback.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2495b33287d1f6304ced931b4ac805cde1c598fe0bcec8a89be8caaa85215af9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="14ca775d9c3ba39c0d26a944ed6967826feac9f020ab67a6c0a36e30cb3ca9f1">
      <data key="d0">Some of the industrial units in Hordern Place have a small setback with parking in front.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2495b33287d1f6304ced931b4ac805cde1c598fe0bcec8a89be8caaa85215af9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="879da24039dd2a70fb04787a2d700a08f2671e2c4a340d1798e2babc139b85f4">
      <data key="d0">Parking within the precinct is generally unrestricted where available and appears highly utilised.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2495b33287d1f6304ced931b4ac805cde1c598fe0bcec8a89be8caaa85215af9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="60c0ccf18d09f83bdc8fcd1903a75655c3de61c9a7541f3cbfad3347682ae80b">
