    <node id="58de33ecc1579aacf82a282516f153355466761958533c8bbe57d8e41762ef02">
      <data key="d0">flood issues</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">11fe28923451a7d454c01e4f03446d07020b93c213d057b9b3cf0bb441f4af7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2a15944235071d3478752c04473d24526f4fca08817d9257af7aded1e780dfc6">
      <data key="d0">Evidence of this history is still visible today with the Sewerage Pumping Station No. 271 located at the northern section of the precinct.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">11fe28923451a7d454c01e4f03446d07020b93c213d057b9b3cf0bb441f4af7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="31f9e0051d8d69309852be502e467006a827d14e77bf2783bc421b04f2ece15d">
      <data key="d0">That site is a Heritage Item of State and local significance.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">11fe28923451a7d454c01e4f03446d07020b93c213d057b9b3cf0bb441f4af7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="376f28c30dfc90f6495f568a3d079cceb038c37f5cb6165654098b2db89f6434">
      <data key="d0">Due to the history of the land in this area the vast majority of the precinct is identified as flood affected.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">11fe28923451a7d454c01e4f03446d07020b93c213d057b9b3cf0bb441f4af7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ddc6e9d164f2a3a896ce6c9198f749d9fa32c37cacf9c0877f07c089ef39a40a">
      <data key="d0">However, the precinct contains a number of Heritage Items, some of State significance.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">11fe28923451a7d454c01e4f03446d07020b93c213d057b9b3cf0bb441f4af7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="4ec6c6e4693155d58381a4d7738f5b743f923c08582b4123997f23aaa6b26f2a">
      <data key="d0">To protect, preserve and enhance the identified period buildings within the precinct.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">11fe28923451a7d454c01e4f03446d07020b93c213d057b9b3cf0bb441f4af7c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5b3cf1a0256a57fa3f868583b22974c2838b995069ef7ff9c5d2e82b1ca8e96b">
      <data key="d0">To ensure that potential flooding issues are addressed as part of any new development.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">11fe28923451a7d454c01e4f03446d07020b93c213d057b9b3cf0bb441f4af7c</data>
