    </node>
    <node id="476cf30d24b0e3c5950bb75edefcacd9237b9ba6f54f5ba8584614a8038ea775">
      <data key="d0">Development within the precinct will need to have regard to this section of the DCP as well as other relevant provisions in the DCP.</data>
