      <data key="d0">Sydenham Pit and Drainage Pumping Station</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="4fe5cb8618ff97858cf4d6e8f3f6de8eeae6bab731c88a13d80ef2da5a5ef2da">
      <data key="d0">number of listed heritage items</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0cb5dc2d9222be91da4dd4564ff560289ea70de64f911b8abe383ace291af9dd">
      <data key="d0">The land-use pattern of the area generally consists of a mixture of general industrial uses, some commercial (business) uses, and some light industrial uses in the south western section of the precinct.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c994799c2a2d6ddecd25611e19dbdb61cae4ef23373c4f3f3a822304def2424f">
      <data key="d0">Properties south of Marrickville Road, with frontages onto Meeks Road are zoned for office and light industrial uses,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="4de5ba9c26bedb8e0484a2069dc523635a7df09bba5096c6624c7ee76d5205fc">
      <data key="d0">The average height in the precinct is one to three storeys.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="a3ad68ae03409ca101f8c0092f26aeb53a3273dc60505695bc410a59ad60f86a">
      <data key="d0">However, the precinct does contain a number of listed heritage items, one of State Significance., being the Sydenham Pit and Drainage Pumping Station.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="70d71d383b8733a4cb81dc64cfb0cfd866eb7f538b3b427dcd1b0feeaea0dfa3">
      <data key="d0">The entire precinct is affected by flooding.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
    <node id="839d64e5044c5c553d43e39b4d6c0e599218252fc2de9d519703722aefe2752b">
      <data key="d0">Properties south of Marrickville Road, with frontages onto Meeks Road are zoned for office and light industrial uses, creating a buffer between residential and industrial uses.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">d75dbe252b61d79761ba73891b0415c184a780bae30d4f82df48facfcd9d4799</data>
    </node>
