    </node>
    <node id="9a18cea4f978f43eed4bd162bce49bfa66ac4acca14c07af45644e1a37c74835">
      <data key="d0">The Planning Document was adopted by Marrickville Council in 2010.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="660ffe5871cefb8e6e37cbf149144cd561baeb921542881cc784f9ec42f48b23">
      <data key="d0">A public exhibition of the draft DCP was held for 8 weeks.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="af515ac0805971de40f11825e6045e60535b97cb3305f2567bc25ffcb222fe47">
      <data key="d0">The Planning Document was placed on public exhibition in June 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="552d0cfe55c422895e1a36092f5fef0c96b89ee2ee6e589614bd9e63e82b1b18">
      <data key="d0">The draft DCP included a range of new and amended policies, including those relating to heritage conservation.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2a631fd21cb925ace1610c8ff3795da56d59d42c242d055ce8b33596dcef9705">
      <data key="d0">There had been significant community interest in the proposed changes to the DCP since 2009.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0985133a7baaa916c5bb62d39a54b4f7b463c2e72a16ba67bdda649a48f9e69f">
      <data key="d0">The Marrickville Council sought to address these concerns through the revision of the DCP.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5965d1fd71552e0c728b09c11db77c1b74f36f6ab9a0f8cdaec3e7cd8e41716a">
      <data key="d0">The Marrickville Council adopted Marrickville DCP 2011 on 23 February 2010.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c3ff4889c3ba4e0376b0d7b68693ac7aa6bac20eb3d4d5eb4b9d4e137f940b23">
      <data key="d0">Marrickville DCP 2004 was reviewed and updated to produce Marrickville DCP 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="cc62efa8d583065aedff2733578bd7f23a73438052b00c480058a54d56bd384b">
      <data key="d0">Marrickville DCP 2004</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2e46dba8c9d8edb6e0f8994e5ec52821e67df243f34bdf21b3af01fccff01d77">
      <data key="d0">The Planning Assessment Commission (PAC) was consulted during the review and update process of Marrickville DCP 2004.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">9590c98e3065b3beb08b2ffd66b0556b9324b2aa3bc03edb432e648eebeff613</data>
    </node>
