    <node id="02422e5c53a5ecaf151c24e6a612687a966bc62ce3ba21dd2db1ca1731556ad5">
      <data key="d0">Any new development (new building or extension to an existing building) shall produce site coverage similar in pattern and size to the site coverage established by the original development of the suburb</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">608fe0df03f538e825ba3c5db398630f2076fa183252f3cedaf78570fccb1272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="8c0ff7a446e108c4a9f69e432c5ece7ec69c2a7675e256571b4e7c366f28e23b">
      <data key="d0">Extensions shall not conceal, dominate, or otherwise compete with the original shape, height, proportion and scale or architectural character of the existing building</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">608fe0df03f538e825ba3c5db398630f2076fa183252f3cedaf78570fccb1272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ff1b6d8d70cb2452eff81f80fcde0d62ac4dc493089038098a10325794043674">
      <data key="d0">Extensions are only permitted to the rear of the existing dwelling, extensions are not permitted to the side of an existing dwelling</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">608fe0df03f538e825ba3c5db398630f2076fa183252f3cedaf78570fccb1272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ccde6d722ac6d7d8af6e8a6b50d509f03af4f711356490e539063ea5cf3b6dbd">
      <data key="d0">Side setback areas and gardens should not be filled in</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">608fe0df03f538e825ba3c5db398630f2076fa183252f3cedaf78570fccb1272</data>
    </node>
