    <node id="ff4bf6aa06c47b0ee9ffd4aa41c0eaaf10980eb676e088dadeba764b3f3d3f1f">
      <data key="d0">Enhance the character and heritage significance of heritage items and heritage conservation areas and ensure that infill development is designed to respond positively to the heritage character of adjoining and nearby heritage buildings and heritage features in the public domain.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
