    </node>
    <node id="27b45fc09499b0df07feb69f09c8033fe54d19b6b52ae6341c317672af5fdfb4">
      <data key="d0">Heritage conservation does not preclude change but does require heritage values to be retained and managed when development takes place.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">ab59c71153b36b3a31c41a8630d8a48a9746b14902e53abffbe110c0456c09c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c5e33bc149c17fc3230d286acd01aabd4a4e3dc3e538a0d5193f97ef760f1e0c">
      <data key="d0">This Development Control Plan (DCP) is consistent with the Australia International Council on Monuments and Sites (ICOMOS) Charter for Conservation of Places of Cultural Significance (The Burra Charter) 2013.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">ab59c71153b36b3a31c41a8630d8a48a9746b14902e53abffbe110c0456c09c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="12acdf80df9cf20b6169e14d7a9b5e7ef596e0e8821051274c688ad9c72802b3">
      <data key="d0">Australia International Council on Monuments and Sites (ICOMOS)</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">ab59c71153b36b3a31c41a8630d8a48a9746b14902e53abffbe110c0456c09c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="3deaba82fbe2b03324fa2cb807ec06d21d8c8b7133be88a787c44cc8bcf631e5">
      <data key="d0">The Burra Charter 2013</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">ab59c71153b36b3a31c41a8630d8a48a9746b14902e53abffbe110c0456c09c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="9c322d802e252f7daf912780e613fe088bf2ff554574a43c7a8050246d5ec55d">
      <data key="d0">Change should be based on an understanding of heritage significance, and The level of change should respect the heritage significance of the item or area.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">ab59c71153b36b3a31c41a8630d8a48a9746b14902e53abffbe110c0456c09c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="a5018321f8cff4491b65503c99be3708b17c8afd0df1893d2118db0e8bcb1e9e">
      <data key="d0">heritage significance</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">ab59c71153b36b3a31c41a8630d8a48a9746b14902e53abffbe110c0456c09c6</data>
    </node>
