    <node id="adda803c46753f241982c809e64236012798a83474eafd0e3fa644fe09ec08a5">
      <data key="d0">The environmental performance of the site must consider matters such as energy demand reduction.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ab1074142f01021286787279d84068cabf287cb8d08b3f0e45c5e347af121157">
      <data key="d0">Stormwater Drainage System must be designed to comply with Part E of this Development Control Plan.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="28daa6a6109ae27417f0d0d3231fc65109ee120aa2f7829920921d0ef0949c84">
      <data key="d0">Any development of the site must also consider matters such as water reduction and land use and ecology.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="49a9bca50b06b72029c0814089b4d483e4b90350ebf9941e9f66de8ae68fb587">
      <data key="d0">Two vehicular access/egress points are to be located per Figure G44.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="843fa732fad7bffae22d038c9169e2673da2769b9a4b57a515d26d74b8b95e83">
      <data key="d0">The total number of car spaces for residents and visitors shall equate to the minimum required by the plan.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="cf1d25a74d03ac9cf14bd81e35bbd9a78d8e6065e910c4106784f30b773d93cb">
      <data key="d0">Ramps and excavation required for vehicle access and egress is to be setback a minimum of 4.5m from the property boundary.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="a4908bdef78500cea3aa41d37e6131daa53510f4be5e4c03887b5044d3cbcf8b">
      <data key="d0">Vehicular access and egress is to be no less than 6m in width.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="78e80331a0673c9519e07c8697d7209282402e81e0879b60f5b6a35c1a2c0baa">
      <data key="d0">The total number of car spaces for residents and visitors shall equate to the minimum of 0.9 spaces per 2-bedroom dwelling.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7ddc2115be26644e5093005434264e1e219583eaa6aee1fbc119ef3be58488d0">
      <data key="d0">All bicycle parking is to comply with the provisions contained in the ‘Parking’ section of this Plan.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="4c72f89940ea08ea73e7f94ccb3516ebb7d6d854d6720bfd8159d9057302a53c">
      <data key="d0">The environmental performance of the site must consider the following matters: 'energy': demand reduction, use efficiency, and generation,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ba5285161ba6eed0085fb13784ce5c92f70ebc268b94fd66aa1d68a32884204d">
      <data key="d0">environment</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">f88c1bbef80a1f84b1c549f4f3a950ae10667f5c4fcca2524ae65ffad24a99a9</data>
    </node>
