      <data key="d0">the controls in this section shall prevail in relation to development on the site</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0451156cc041038dec744466e34524834b21e3413b5eba9eddb9f5718b7cf41d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d64a1c6de6e19da8259fcfe7bac1bedcc8e4c220179c5c31adebe7c910ac103a">
      <data key="d0">Future development on the site is to include employment uses associated with health, education, creative and technology sectors.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0451156cc041038dec744466e34524834b21e3413b5eba9eddb9f5718b7cf41d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5a0a4b0fda610157a9a512dfc9e47998bde650a197f3ee9fb59c8d76c2862844">
      <data key="d0">Ground floor uses are to provide street level activation, passive surveillance and opportunities for social interaction around:</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0451156cc041038dec744466e34524834b21e3413b5eba9eddb9f5718b7cf41d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5e7aa3dad44a51c46df468126c87b4ab474886a36f8e2e12fc6b3bf63aeef1e2">
      <data key="d0">New development on the site is to follow the lot amalgamation pattern identified in Figure 3.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0451156cc041038dec744466e34524834b21e3413b5eba9eddb9f5718b7cf41d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="95c2285c7d5a460a9a039a32fc60ec5414ccc7abe28aef58575f07a3848a20f0">
      <data key="d0">To incorporate setbacks which support an active, pedestrian-focused development</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
