    </node>
    <node id="c365126921c60411f0e5fbfebaa0038b647a6aabbb23e5f25488e3fcdd62d9f4">
      <data key="d0">To provide an appropriate built form response in terms of bulk, massing, height, separation, setbacks, amenity, articulation and modulation.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">0451156cc041038dec744466e34524834b21e3413b5eba9eddb9f5718b7cf41d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ba5c2f1f36dd6c99662e29e8360d31288d2055ae65aa93fac0a4c47a11bdade4">
      <data key="d0">All development should be designed and constructed in accordance with the controls in this section.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
