      <data key="d0">Flood control lot</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="163cf92617ba27515ce01f04e36409f27d94944a3b4de546eb02a31b9ace4f82">
      <data key="d0">Floodplain</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="b6baff9358ddd8f760a539c3f4b36a3314876e86597f3465a3623b6be3f3cf29">
      <data key="d0">Land</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ff5ecba619dd92bb8df4db9c394fd1ad4a32323373036debb225805f37ee1c6e">
      <data key="d0">Amenity means the enjoyment of the environment whether by the community or an individual arising from the day to day use of property including dwellings or publicly accessible land, community facilities or open space.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="943a4cc35830be9e5d443073698f09a6ec765193c2f52523f4a02dcd9e53d016">
      <data key="d0">the enjoyment of sunlight, privacy and views, and residential and community life free from nuisance arising from the emission of noise, vibration, smell, fumes, smoke, vapour, steam, soot, ash, dust, waste water, waste products or grit.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d9300bcf5660540bb06e9de9bc174049372621d4a86edfda00f03a5336f416ef">
      <data key="d0">Conservation may, according to circumstance, include the processes of retention or reintroduction of a use, retention of associations and meanings, maintenance, preservation, restoration, reconstruction, adaptation and interpretation,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c4a257e443493a31d2982d9383c0de190c9421d9827f0131f221b8c98838a6d1">
      <data key="d0">and will commonly include a combination of more than one of these.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="42ec2afc7e65aad3bf95699ec919434dea42a2ab6323c09f47345875cab80852">
      <data key="d0">Contaminated land means land in, on or under which any substance is present at a concentration above the concentration at which the substance is normally present in, on or under (respectively) land in the same locality,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="66da1169d589c4b0d0b66743e1fba185fe5a9c0e7490f62f8f38ac0e68fff744">
      <data key="d0">being a presence that presents a risk of harm to human health or any other aspect of the environment.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="838a0301b36855389399313eb42b8d11589d42207f93e137e7dabcc1c33d7756">
      <data key="d0">Contributory item means a building in a Conservation Area that is not individually listed as a heritage item but by virtue of age, scale, materials, details, design style or intactness is consistent with the conservation area,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="f505c84b343470cdf28b5d542073fa84d78985de4ffcb4e55030d04efb45ad91">
      <data key="d0">and therefore reinforces its heritage significance.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="791e283a90cd43a82607fa69694c873e4d6c8fa253a2194b7788b58409a77edf">
      <data key="d0">Cultural significance means aesthetic, historic, scientific, social or spiritual value for past, present or future generations.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0f9377be1529c919cea2f768cd48d540fafa9bb4c20a56d5c26ce9c4541d1296">
      <data key="d0">that can be preserved through conservation.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="595b889f67b8650111a0493eaad333e5c448cf716e5d555a409ed2397ddb4649">
      <data key="d0">Flood certificate means a certificate obtained from Council which provides flooding information for the area in the vicinity of a particular property including peak water levels, depths and flow rates for the 100 year ARI,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="fed892cc0970e3807d85672c7256f742115275ae999c9425df5716a7fea6e0c7">
      <data key="d0">and peak water levels for the Probable Maximum Flood event.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="38a7e9b3606435f2b69ad35aae899459c5cb84992858975c59fbb06ffa951dab">
      <data key="d0">Flood control lot means a lot identified as a flood control lot on the maps in Appendix E of this Development Control Plan (DCP).</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d728ccd38aa76d6f36facf8ff9511244405a6a8e866684ea89507195034f1292">
      <data key="d0">All flood control lots are also within flood hazard areas as defined by the BCA.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="4f8e09208248c97cc0f966b2b81b2eeee272b64725c877dc7f89a95d19591f7f">
      <data key="d0">Floodplain means an area of land which is subject to inundation by floods up to and including the probable maximum flood event,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">53c13b983665ff26d3da688f01dce36924ff8f47738cc075f3d25157128dfe1a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2c66130c45e1669d86260a77749c27437f6e6d6543007a28e298d6792a856a8a">
      <data key="d0">that is, flood prone land.</data>
