    <node id="ee333daed5617da9e8051bda94e5fe8be94e4c93f5916fe0ecdd5dc1a00134fe">
      <data key="d0">This Development Control Plan includes objectives and controls which will assist Council to implement its strategic direction as outlined in the adopted Leichhardt Community and Cultural Plan 2011-2021.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e113462f5dec17e383635fc4a1e5c7e6faee8cfdd50b4dbfa59f0b5d32b4bb25">
      <data key="d0">The Leichhardt Development Control Plan 2013 will assist Council in making important decisions about the physical environment and activities within it</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="63bc4c42b66577d5e5678fabaf35d43a2e1dcfbb4c9948ee94715b9e8ec03162">
      <data key="d0">Council encourages urban design that accommodates active travel options such as walking, cycling and public transport between homes, workplaces, centres and attractions.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="167c547a11a73844e09be4aed3f6396ea86ed2f745e7187845a70dec0a366f6b">
      <data key="d0">Council supports the provision of quality open space, sporting and recreation facilities that are accessible for all.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e338999c9aa0c27f0b40fdb6de17fec4aff6254d89fb9a81587c9620f531bb7d">
      <data key="d0">Council supports the development of streets that are attractive and safe for all members of the local community.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2c347f5fe4e9da8bdc3112ec6d76b0343f947851d8e09dd697634f1cbbff1f82">
      <data key="d0">Council supports urban design that accommodates active travel options such as walking, cycling and public transport between homes, workplaces, centres and attractions.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="9269d462e520371440cbffca33b40f3e4958327c87233799cae124c4a274c8dc">
      <data key="d0">Council supports the development of town centres and other key destinations in the municipality to provide safe, vibrant and attractive streetscapes both day and night.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1b6532e0ad188245641eafee1559752c2c5db11c02229182364acba149bb7d03">
      <data key="d0">Council supports private development that addresses the street and is well connected to movement systems (i.e. streets, laneways, paths, open space etc.).</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
    <node id="6dafa72ecaf424be3c4107926e54bae3594e07048c607ffa2266025a70574a52">
      <data key="d0">The Leichhardt Development Control Plan 2013 will assist Council in making important decisions about the physical environment and activities within it to support the wider social and economic needs and community aspirations on land where this DCP applies, including the special and individual needs of the old, young, disabled, indigenous and those from diverse cultural backgrounds.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">7b7552619b2f38bdfe43488d89f0ffc480e6a2ef5b2d355b7e920edf79305362</data>
    </node>
