    <node id="d6ea2ba0416f06c001ca8976498f82506324ac563616ff8acc239bb4df07c756">
      <data key="d0">The Leichhardt Council adopted the plan in 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">6040e958c3b7ed037e6c6aa77fc8861a882c596dc5515626a05128e77a038b8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="25e76dbdec928b2a902325a9ade6dd5e5012c6fccc011138fce90bf173421a1b">
      <data key="d0">The DCP was gazetted on 3 December 2013.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">6040e958c3b7ed037e6c6aa77fc8861a882c596dc5515626a05128e77a038b8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="01a79f6f5e6ec9388793c00cbf7a8e8f608cb18cd14a850c15b89c6009423de9">
      <data key="d0">The Draft Plan was exhibited for public comment from 25 November to 23 December 2010.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">6040e958c3b7ed037e6c6aa77fc8861a882c596dc5515626a05128e77a038b8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="317659c5bec4ac928281784edace0d5a4cdc335d5e0c7859d2aefb75e5e66f39">
      <data key="d0">The Draft Plan proposed changes to reduce building heights and increase setbacks along certain parts of streets in Leichhardt, Camperdown and Petersham.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">6040e958c3b7ed037e6c6aa77fc8861a882c596dc5515626a05128e77a038b8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d490442d278cbba87c4266c8a54a7aeb3648bba021e69239a54ad24526eb0a7d">
      <data key="d0">The changes were designed to improve amenity and livability in these areas.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">6040e958c3b7ed037e6c6aa77fc8861a882c596dc5515626a05128e77a038b8d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e1b1b950c87314672ee0fd93cce412e17a6c2c62eae8c53060a1d779a7dd7370">
