    <node id="b789e44c60fe021583210134b6339aac2e93122ca7bbbaa76b6958b78fb60829">
      <data key="d0">Setbacks from the street frontage greater than zero are only generally acceptable where that setback: a. would be part of the fabric of a Heritage Item, or enables greater visual access to a Heritage Item on an adjoining site, b. is for a ground floor non-residential use and the setback is no greater than 3m and allows for a semi-public space such as a courtyard that provides a high level of interaction with the street, and c. is for the provision of a new useable public domain such as a plaza.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">54559fc29f95147cb5d83e8f2b25f809c00900abe4f2928e317af9d6727d4ab2</data>
