    <node id="68f5ee72781a074665d6418bb913292bf7b437cc290c1ef34236b91c31c53a7d">
      <data key="d0">The installation of a photovoltaic system may be granted development consent when it can be shown that the installation will not result in irreversible alteration.</data>
