    <node id="7d065b9b42f84d26ee4aa707642d73157173899269a4e85fa1d701a9185a9703">
      <data key="d0">The aim of this Chapter is to promote an integrated and co-ordinated approach to land use planning in the coastal zone.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">753784ab23b249f527fd9d4c4cfa71796407c0699984f96274843c6b35705199</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ad0f8077951d5b767da186d0cbc8a9a9953e2cb17ad32e0fe2a6eabdc24bbad8">
      <data key="d0">This Chapter applies to land within the coastal zone.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">753784ab23b249f527fd9d4c4cfa71796407c0699984f96274843c6b35705199</data>
    </node>
    <node id="3213900f31a645abe96ce2c8e39e00bd480bd4788c8be4a7bc5e555c52d36f60">
      <data key="d0">This Chapter promotes an integrated and co-ordinated approach to land use planning in the coastal zone by managing development in the coastal zone.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">753784ab23b249f527fd9d4c4cfa71796407c0699984f96274843c6b35705199</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d2aa365bd33d28fa09a18f8717b476b087a0650838f882decde26d87f085a788">
      <data key="d0">The following may be carried out on land identified as “coastal wetlands” or “littoral rainforest” on the Coastal Wetlands and Littoral Rainforests Area Map only with development consent.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">753784ab23b249f527fd9d4c4cfa71796407c0699984f96274843c6b35705199</data>
    </node>
    <node id="26705207cd32fa5138b9f54eed2f8a6d0012a71d1f10cffba1175f9f12d6b0f5">
      <data key="d0">The clearing of native vegetation within the meaning of Part 5A of the Local Land Services Act 2013, may be carried out on land identified as “coastal wetlands” or “littoral rainforest” on the Coastal Wetlands and Littoral Rainforests Area Map only with development consent.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">753784ab23b249f527fd9d4c4cfa71796407c0699984f96274843c6b35705199</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c5b2f4e17dda61ac153f4063911ae6db3347d4ac4cc8ac9539db4511897f5bf0">
      <data key="d0">The harm of mangroves, saltmarshes, seagrass meadows, coastal dunes, and other ecological communities within the meaning of Part 5A of the Local Land Services Act 2013, may be carried out on land identified as “coastal wetlands” or “littoral rainforest” on the Coastal Wetlands and Littoral Rainforests Area Map only with development consent.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">753784ab23b249f527fd9d4c4cfa71796407c0699984f96274843c6b35705199</data>
    </node>
