    <node id="3b462b96e0f350859fbe38363f8cce113ebd744c4eef34e6d7f629fc9f3329b5">
      <data key="d0">This DCP is to be read in conjunction with Inner West Local Environmental Plan 2022.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f6ae9d9cbe0ae3d1ddf318ceaad609411ca8b879b613847dae1f84f652c57f52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7a7400772a3918811f023bf181fc3ca358c30d2f9cda11d7e57d433f3eb8f2d5">
      <data key="d0">In the event of an inconsistency between the provisions of the two documents, the provisions of Inner West LEP 2022 shall prevail to the extent of the inconsistency.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f6ae9d9cbe0ae3d1ddf318ceaad609411ca8b879b613847dae1f84f652c57f52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0f2b7bab761e584bd97b1f97883cfeeb27f719c8aa36cf36edd51c6ff152941b">
      <data key="d0">The purpose of this DCP is to supplement the provisions of Inner West LEP 2022 and provide more detailed provisions to guide development.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f6ae9d9cbe0ae3d1ddf318ceaad609411ca8b879b613847dae1f84f652c57f52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="336f0e24313c7be870b1282c43165c7343dbb484d014b67b85a25e4fac6fe607">
      <data key="d0">Under Section 4.15 of the EP &amp; A Act, Council is required to consider the relevant provisions of this DCP when assessing a development application.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f6ae9d9cbe0ae3d1ddf318ceaad609411ca8b879b613847dae1f84f652c57f52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="f1a93d6a23f248007d0aecac4d5da1171ccb9cd3c774c6ae8345af24173dd4ac">
      <data key="d0">Build upon Inner West LEP 2022 by providing detailed objectives and controls for development.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f6ae9d9cbe0ae3d1ddf318ceaad609411ca8b879b613847dae1f84f652c57f52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d6b62e9c18a0b77ccd779bf9a05aec8e705eb36590f95e93630817e2ab1e9f09">
      <data key="d0">To maintain and enhance the environmental and cultural heritage of the Marrickville LGA.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f6ae9d9cbe0ae3d1ddf318ceaad609411ca8b879b613847dae1f84f652c57f52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e43ccf351eabc7f4fe5e4fdce3ea36f765a803e15b69b446e2761bfc177e1bdd">
      <data key="d0">To ensure that development considers the principles of ecologically sustainable development, in particular energy, water and stormwater efficiency, solar access, waste reduction and local biodiversity.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">f6ae9d9cbe0ae3d1ddf318ceaad609411ca8b879b613847dae1f84f652c57f52</data>
    </node>
