    <node id="5affe15bf4f40d2aa1b69d4c02e56f1b90ed5c89470dea1fea129b4c9936693a">
      <data key="d0">The Stormwater Drainage Concept Plan includes existing and proposed ground and floor levels, surface flow path treatment, easements required, on-site detention storages, and details of internal piped systems.</data>
