    <node id="92fe097db672a6425319d6a31eb2f61ea839bd8d334f09e5d40508cd093ba47b">
      <data key="d0">effectiveness of advertising</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="cce25400ea53814c4c9b8763ee71bffd77882e30f068bd22a6d549c014efd7d4">
      <data key="d0">design quality</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="c07d5f770e124f07bd1500e5b73f90713672bce9866b7b6123f367b85edd9eb7">
      <data key="d0">compatibility with architectural design</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="6d9b667a2f38fc1c0263031fb54dea91090a8226e179c88aaade7c2036eca0c5">
      <data key="d0">local streetscape</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="365ba574eff171f83e2622f1297a7bd07002b80d9432e21f7cce9e6c582c88b7">
      <data key="d0">visual prominence and integrity of the roof</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="5fac1d526875c4dec56881e06c5b107d4ce69a2cf48aa9797e5de7800d212a92">
      <data key="d0">These provisions are intended to protect the significant characteristics of retail/commercial strips, neighbourhoods, buildings, streetscapes, vistas and the skyline.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="26e214fa85d3bbc14bca7f34cf6236fc0e61ce98c58987a9fa7e5fc574a152bc">
      <data key="d0">Clause 2.12 specifies Council’s objectives and requirements for the erection and display of advertising signs.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="edacff806862be6db788292bf2be8cd3c9c75ef46e1906bcdf4eb9a506dfb98f">
      <data key="d0">Advertising signs clearly indicate retail and commercial uses, and contribute to lively retail strips.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="45034e60f72c47b5cb1dfbf2524940d14cef82e78041b619f7b33c0f9efa0814">
      <data key="d0">However, too much signage creates visual clutter, detracts from the streetscape quality and reduces the effectiveness of advertising.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="b696b9d67508a8f5ee2fdbb82959d461744411dafb2419145ecfeb778ad30879">
      <data key="d0">To ensure all advertising achieves a high level of design quality and is compatible with the architectural design of the host building, the character of the streetscape and the size and juxtaposition of other signs in the immediate vicinity.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="6fb74c3b47fa174752b078a7b4a54976695a2df4ec434591e8fe15159ff16a1b">
      <data key="d0">To ensure signage does not dominate or detract from the architectural features of the building and from the white-way lighting found along some retail strips.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="be47d3b584fb891f1fdd8ec1b906ead28f1d3f0b06723db1684fdf0763561eea">
      <data key="d0">To ensure advertising does not cause amenity loss, or have a detrimental effect on the natural or built environment or the safety, appearance or efficiency of any public area.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="dc21fcf5d10e03b320242b6ca44258bde45cb844494736f43704eb32351bcbae">
      <data key="d0">Clause 2.12.1 specifies requirements for signage to ensure its compatibility with road safety principles.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2be8872ea362b3bc4e0b3414e2dcaeb2d886d7ce6f8aba84728631e0710e3b5e">
      <data key="d0">To ensure the location and design of signs are consistent with road safety principles.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7f3c5e90808a755e98427415a08c27a018f5a2349f639b5b2006ba48b4f27e3d">
      <data key="d0">To ensure the use of corporate logos, colour and illumination schemes in signage are compatible with the architecture of the host building and do not adversely impact upon the local streetscape.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="082dc68c39c5eb358cfed750038c75e590af6bd34a40c77671926acf60cb0385">
      <data key="d0">To ensure signage retains the visual prominence and integrity of the roof and silhouette form of the business centre.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="86ec8bad3d3a7a839e8a217bcc5ea697bbdaa60d849f6a9631f9aa23c673905c">
      <data key="d0">Clause 2.12.1 specifies requirements for signage to be compatible with the architectural design of the host building.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e99761f27e0f1efcafee75253d81d36f88202356e8982f2fb60a924ad0278cb0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e3d1e9598eeb395a553217fa4aa4b439cb64c2f72335d297e30cbd63f263ff37">
