      <data key="d0">potential adverse environmental impact</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="4513613d4cf72317b502a175e2c767c07b797e3bb98c1c5ca2bb668dbdd0bbc3">
      <data key="d0">scale compatible with the character, landscape and scenic qualities of the area</data>
      <data key="d1">entity</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="124adf0d1701aeb6da6de7d2f2e78da879c4a2f187e5598df9254217bbeec096">
      <data key="d0">The following objectives apply to land that contains unique environmental features.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0b30a8d45c3a22aa3f2f871281d226fe996f3405f7e33e08fe629f2c28f57df5">
      <data key="d0">Additional objectives and controls also apply to land in the Thornley Street Scenic Protection Area.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="842e61785088d14ce91b11dc49740952fc9c18b45c008c439ef033da6a8561d5">
      <data key="d0">Development must be designed to address any distinctive environmental features of the site or on adjoining nearby land.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="fd225e6014b69adc344d9bec68d90d02a648105bfaa161ac9c8ac38b430ddf8a">
      <data key="d0">Development must respond to these features by appropriately considering outlook, the location of structures, design and materials.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="972a7f00b3a01f24a507e7e1c366caed4dad7d28973ca24e6e11f9cb349ce694">
      <data key="d0">Clearing of vegetation must be minimised and colours and materials selected that integrate with the characteristics of the area.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="d5ddfb941289021adc011fca5a62971e080c95ee4ad4784c4660ca61c4cb66b4">
      <data key="d0">Development within the scenic protection area must be designed and located to minimise potential adverse environmental impact.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="26ec371ec8061ce27ed35827f83dc4c3fe960466cecf200a40993404c53ce28b">
      <data key="d0">The Thornley Street scenic protection area is an area with unique environmental features and has been identified for its landscape, cultural and scenic qualities.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="02ec4fd8291cf7db6237ad8efb972d42ef3591cb8362f262548c816a553e6f7a">
      <data key="d0">Development within the scenic protection area must be: of a scale compatible with the character, landscape and scenic qualities of the area.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="9ee182069a7a19c5255c454894f888217e37f1a5461fc72e01c67c4a80ff2148">
      <data key="d0">Development adjoining public open space must be set back from open space and be of a height and scale appropriate to the unique environmental qualities of the area.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="61fa3399461cadbe908c3a3178b9af8246c2d5ff741c260de40bf5535d3ea107">
      <data key="d0">The following objectives, controls and design solutions apply to land that contains unique environmental features.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">33b911c1e8a6f8732d1140ef0ac37e8c6b4b16715cebe8749b5fd7ec16c383e8</data>
