      <data key="d0">Subdivision or site amalgamation must not compromise the significant features of the existing site or adjoining sites,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="59e99537518010b22fe341b3360a5c826cb6a70572e2673f93bd37d5dad66b49">
      <data key="d0">Site topography and other natural and physical features of the land must be considered.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="e7e3d50c8165e9019b6e05813fce26eec83892d7cd61df7a19298110aee4b8ad">
      <data key="d0">Existing services, Existing vegetation, Existing easements or the need for any new easements,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="0e5dbe8fe84ce4aa9d6dc5df5400041830ff6516e79836a01fcb1df0e612b2b3">
      <data key="d0">Corner properties must have splayed corners for road widening purposes.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="efabc296649246c755996e8174cc6901518715bcdbc872e631c3cab6181cb496">
      <data key="d0">Splays will generally be as follows: 3 metres x 3 metres at street and street corner,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="dc6d52ea83bb1fc24df4f3921f0ff92f50574a29f9b0d6d2ae32ae8b0845c8a5">
      <data key="d0">Development consent must be sought for any continuing use on the newly proposed lots.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="980895aff65f9117a230be13ed1fcd6ee907ad9967488fba3cda81fca08bfd88">
      <data key="d0">When a proposal involves boundary adjustment or excision of land where it is proposed to continue existing uses:</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="fd76b904f592b207f85a177bdf2f96c688d78370eaea50f84279f39115367bef">
      <data key="d0">The arrangement of new lot boundaries must not create any non-compliances with any controls within this DCP.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="6c9236a4c335d22fa15c2a8060d597c248213d8122e973be70bf74caf82970d9">
      <data key="d0">Development consent, by way of a new application must be sought for any continuing use on the newly proposed lots,</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">327d5c5a4518394d99ba13202a679b7a367cb03a1a19a9220df4de5701488785</data>
    </node>
