    <node id="14826d16a210f0dadeaf62796665156eb2e0efd11d47e60d5e8e8b35f666153d">
      <data key="d0">The document is titled Marrickville DCP 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e4651eacf6c9b95855c7ad44a399ddbe723dd17daf875f26bd1a4e3aad43de7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="6a4b5bd3c470554e4b40d5bf2534667c5215e1fcf1dfeb1590646c825c1e5340">
      <data key="d0">It was adopted by the Marrickville Council in 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e4651eacf6c9b95855c7ad44a399ddbe723dd17daf875f26bd1a4e3aad43de7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="6cf6dcc7890ae136e9e941823bbc221e1f574e84974558322c65d7bd37e750a3">
      <data key="d0">The document was adopted by the Marrickville Council in 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e4651eacf6c9b95855c7ad44a399ddbe723dd17daf875f26bd1a4e3aad43de7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="8e0ac5c915cdf6b4f2532982b938bdb3d58e58f047d975583b5b7dcdfbffbce7">
      <data key="d0">Councillor Sam Iskandar, Mayor of Marrickville at the time, welcomed the adoption of the DCP.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e4651eacf6c9b95855c7ad44a399ddbe723dd17daf875f26bd1a4e3aad43de7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="571093c3ce96baca78c64256cb5e3e848dfc78b010d6d1e0233f21c96d863682">
      <data key="d0">The Marrickville Council had been working on the development control plan for several years prior to its adoption.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e4651eacf6c9b95855c7ad44a399ddbe723dd17daf875f26bd1a4e3aad43de7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="788b4202c089e6e9ad4d291c20a8be749a67525bf710a24ed7eb8a62476bbf12">
      <data key="d0">He believed that it would provide a framework for sustainable development in Marrickville.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">e4651eacf6c9b95855c7ad44a399ddbe723dd17daf875f26bd1a4e3aad43de7e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="7c27f41b12273cbf47dce3bae5c3a2551f058e70d3f1378d3d6f881175c8bba3">
