    <node id="30b190ba0677e2fa245bd430c9959305e08c0864e0bd7a474114890339c186d0">
      <data key="d0">The Dulwich Hill Commercial Precinct Heritage Conservation Area is of aesthetic significance as a largely intact retailing precinct which retains original parapeted roof forms, recessed shopfronts and generally intact first floor shop facades.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">1042249278f9da9e6b6f2659a3c679911271d0e9c2f6bc8a533c23123f390169</data>
