    <node id="c4ad5cc0baf323a8d41b868b629c6bf41e781c11ed67269bbcd7e0adaf5600c4">
      <data key="d0">The planning document is titled Marrickville DCP 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">383fdc031f7397b080b45c0d05acb4fd381c82d3090369d425c56eee08e24649</data>
    </node>
    <node id="32fbd2b48e64b533e083adf89a59c98c73e2a2058730b84b416decdde1948ad2">
      <data key="d0">It was adopted by Marrickville Council in 2011.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">383fdc031f7397b080b45c0d05acb4fd381c82d3090369d425c56eee08e24649</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1a6b227bf6f92473d1f1f3ff6bea22cee3f18570534ac3e039f5bac0103c9103">
      <data key="d0">Previous versions of the document were published in 2007 and 2009.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">383fdc031f7397b080b45c0d05acb4fd381c82d3090369d425c56eee08e24649</data>
    </node>
    <node id="216163cf5c598d1bea873f2a171db387a4fac17e5fa1967779b92b32af8b069f">
      <data key="d0">The council consulted with the community for several months before publishing them.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">383fdc031f7397b080b45c0d05acb4fd381c82d3090369d425c56eee08e24649</data>
    </node>
    <node id="847347959d63fc31c68cb3692ab503bdc94c575ec7354b1d60103223f0b137c5">
      <data key="d0">A draft of the document was also made available online for public review and comment.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
