    </node>
    <node id="63d55fd566d784bfb2adb5745eb619a55df623fd4704e7982b334d02bb80f499">
      <data key="d0">Development within the precinct is to be undertaken in accordance with the Indicative Site Layout as shown in Figure 1 subject to compliance with relevant controls including the Apartment Design Guide.</data>
