Clause 2.17 - environmental_protection (environmental_protection): Treat stormwater so that the area  reaches the relevant stormwater quality targets for stormwater reuse and/or stormwater entering receiving waters .

Clause 2.17.1 - environmental_protection (environmental_protection): Reduce the consumption of potable water through water efficient fittings and appliances, rainwater harvesting and wastewater reuse.

