Clause 2.5 - access (development_control): Equity  of Access  and Mobility

Clause 2.6 - privacy (development_control): Acoustic  and Visual Privacy

Clause 2.7 - solar_access (development_control): Solar  Access  and Overshadowing

Clause 2.8 - other (development_control): Social  Impact  Assessment

