      <data key="d3">arising from the day to day use of property including dwellings or publicly accessible land, community facilities or open space and includes, but is not limited to, the enjoyment of: Sunlight, privacy and views, and Residential and community life free from nuisance arising from the emission of noise, vibration, smell, fumes, smoke, vapour, steam, soot, ash, dust, waste water, waste products or grit.</data>
